{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS经脚本解释器连接Google日历疑似命令控制。对应需求：命令控制。官方：Google Calendar C2 via Script Interpreter。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.network-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS经脚本解释器连接Google日历疑似命令控制","references":["https://www.veracode.com/resources/sophisticated-npm-attack-leveraging-unicode-steganography-and-google-calendar-c2","https://www.koi.ai/blog/glassworm-first-self-propagating-worm-using-invisible-code-hits-openvsx-marketplace"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"abc7a2be-479e-428b-b0b3-1d22bda46dd9","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 命令控制"],"type":"eql","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS经脚本解释器连接Google日历疑似命令控制\n\n### 为何重要\n建立外连、隧道或远控通道\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","query":"sequence by process.entity_id with maxspan=20s\n  [network where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n    (process.name in (\"node\", \"osascript\") or process.name like \"python*\" or\n     process.code_signature.trusted == false or process.code_signature.exists == false) and\n    destination.domain like \"calendar.app.google*\"]\n  [network where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type == \"start\" and destination.domain == null]\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1102","name":"Web Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1102.001","name":"Dead Drop Resolver","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/001/"},{"id":"T1102.002","name":"Bidirectional Communication","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.002","name":"AppleScript","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/002/"},{"id":"T1059.006","name":"Python","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/006/"},{"id":"T1059.007","name":"JavaScript","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/007/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
